    {
      "date": "2026-04",
      "topic": "海外投资与国际合作",
      "stance_content": "推动Vingroup在印度马哈拉施特拉邦投资65亿美元，涵盖电动汽车制造、电池生产、充电基础设施等多个领域。此举标志着越南企业最大规模海外投资之一，体现了将越南制造业推向全球的战略愿景。",
      "source": "https://www.caproasia.com/2026/04/13/vietnam-richest-billionaire-pham-nhat-vuong-with-27-billion-fortune-vingroup-sign-mou-to-explore-6-5-billion-investments-in-india-state-maharashtra-key-sectors-over-next-2-years-maharashtra-cities/"
    },
    {
